Description: MooZ 4k Intro/2004/Linux
 Cube is a 4k intro written in C with SDL 1.2 and OpenGL by MooZ for the
 2004 Linux 4k compo listed on 320x200.org.
 .
 A grid of small cubes is lit by three metaballs that drift through it:
 each cube grows with the field around it. In rhythm, the picture
 switches between two blur effects made with textures: a soft glow and a
 radial zoom.
 .
 Press any key or close the window to quit.
